      "s8P2": "Ọ dịghị ihe ebe a na-ejide njedebe anyị maka aghụghọ, ma ọ bụ maka ihe ọ bụla enweghị ike ijide n'usoro iwu n'okpuru iwu Naịjirịa. <1>[TO CONFIRM — a lawyer should draft the liability and indemnity wording; a limitation clause written without advice tends to fail precisely when it is relied on.]</1>",
      "s9Title": "9. Imechi akaụntụ gị",
